.TH "SPP-APP-LIST" 1 "November 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
spp-app-list \- List all registered applications, distinguishing system portals from user applications
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B spp app:list
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B app:list
scans the SPP application registry and filesystem to list all active applications.
System-critical portals (\fBsppadmin\fR, \fBsppdev\fR, \fBdefault\fR) are classified under the \fBsystem\fR type with their Dev Mode status displayed.
Modular packages nested under applications (such as \fBSPPDocs\fR sub-packages) are automatically rolled up and displayed as integrated package counts rather than separate standalone entries.
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP \(bu 2
Reads \fIspp/etc/global-settings.yml\fR.
.IP \(bu 2
Traverses \fIsrc/*/packages/\fR to resolve internal package associations.
